    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "- Is employee? + Registered? only send codes to emails in your employees table. Otherwise anyone could use your chat to spam random addresses with emails from your account.\n- Generate code creates a random 6-digit code, valid for 10 minutes.\n- Save code uses upsert: if this email already has a code, it’s replaced, otherwise a new row is added. So each person has only one valid code at a time.\n- Email code sends a branded email with the code shown large in orange.\n- Result nodes return a clear sentence for the agent. Without them, the agent would receive Gmail’s technical response and have to guess what happened.",
